WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.625
Welcome to the introduction to Amazon Ads.

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:09.000
In this video, you'll learn how you can connect with customers through ads on and off Amazon.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Help customers discover your brand and products and grow your business with Amazon Ads Solutions.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Amazon Ads Solutions are designed to help you reach your business goals.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.125
For example, driving sales or increasing brand awareness, regardless of your company's size, stage,

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.000
or budget.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.400
These solutions can help you find, attract, and engage millions of Amazon customers at every stage

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.000
of their shopping journey.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.333
Amazon Ads can help you reach your customers, understand shopping interactions, and measure the

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.000
impact of your advertising on your business.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.368
We can help you learn how your customers interact with your brand across sites owned and operated

00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:49.000
by Amazon.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.316
Our measurement solutions use Amazon first-party metrics and retail insights to provide you with

00:00:55.316 --> 00:00:57.000
context into your performance.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.455
This can help you create better advertising strategies to help increase brand awareness or drive

00:01:02.455 --> 00:01:05.000
sales of new and best-selling products.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Let's explore what Amazon Ads Solutions can work best for you and your brand.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Sponsored products can help customers find your products.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.095
You can promote individual product listings on Amazon by quickly creating ads that appear in related

00:01:19.095 --> 00:01:21.000
shopping results and product pages.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
It generates ads from your product listings and offers automatic targeting.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
In just a few minutes, you can create a campaign even if you've never advertised before.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
If you want to help shoppers explore your full range of products, you may consider creating a store.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:41.957
Stores are free, self-service branded destinations on Amazon where you can curate content that inspires,

00:01:41.957 --> 00:01:45.000
educates, and help shoppers discover your products.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.833
Sponsored brands can help customers discover your brand and explore your products by driving traffic

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:52.000
to your store.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.316
Sponsored brands are creative ads that appear in relevant Amazon shopping results and include custom

00:01:58.316 --> 00:02:00.000
headlines, videos, and images.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Sponsored display is an advertising solution that lets you quickly create display campaigns.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.667
With a budget of any size, reach audiences who showed interest in categories related to your promoted

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:11.000
product,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.667
or re-engage customers off Amazon who previously viewed your product detail page but have yet to

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:17.000
purchase.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:24.043
Amazon DSP is a demand-side platform, or software used to buy digital ads that automates the buying

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.000
and selling of digital advertising,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.000
to reach new and existing audiences on and off Amazon.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
It allows advertisers to bid on and manage multiple ad exchanges through a single interface.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.045
It's available to advertisers who sell products on Amazon and those who do not, both as a self-service

00:02:42.045 --> 00:02:43.000
or managed service.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:49.182
Video ads can help you share your brand message with unique and relevant audiences and scale your

00:02:49.182 --> 00:02:51.000
reach across world-class content.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.053
You can engage with audiences across their streaming and browsing devices whether or not you sell

00:02:56.053 --> 00:02:57.000
products on Amazon.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.375
It's a great way to build awareness for your brand by reaching insight-driven audiences across Amazon-

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:06.000
owned websites and leading third-party publishers.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Audio ads can help brands build awareness, allowing you to communicate your brand message before

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.000
or during audio streaming content,

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.000
like when audiences listen to music or news.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:22.923
Custom advertising solutions capture customers' attention and imagination with innovative, tailor-

00:03:22.923 --> 00:03:24.000
made experiences.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:29.600
We work with brands to develop campaigns that engage consumers at multiple stages of the marketing

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.000
funnel, building brand awareness,

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.000
consideration, and conversion.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.000
With hundreds of millions of active customer accounts worldwide, Amazon has a deep understanding

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.000
of how customers engage with products and brands as they discover and purchase online.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:50.000
We offer a full range of advertising solutions that can help you achieve your advertising goals.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.185
With our insights, reach, and premium entertainment properties, from music to streaming, you can

00:03:55.185 --> 00:04:00.000
connect with the right audiences in the right places at the right time.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Get started with Amazon ads by visiting ads.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:04.500
amazon.

